00:57:51.063 --> 00:57:54.330
Well, I ain't never heard
of the Bible forbidding
the word "shit."


00:57:54.331 --> 00:57:55.670
How about you, Ray?


00:57:55.671 --> 00:57:57.364
Not me.


00:57:57.365 --> 00:57:59.633
Yeah, well, it's not...
it's not that it's a rule
or anything.


00:57:59.634 --> 00:58:01.473
It's just, you know...


00:58:01.474 --> 00:58:03.234
- the idea is the Bible...
- (COUGHS)


00:58:03.235 --> 00:58:04.341
- ...the Bible says...
- Can you... Can you...


00:58:04.342 --> 00:58:06.805
Sorry, can you break off?


00:58:06.806 --> 00:58:08.847
You stink. (CHUCKLES)


00:58:11.084 --> 00:58:13.486
Listen, it's not your fault.
You didn't have time to wipe.


00:58:13.487 --> 00:58:15.847
But we shouldn't all be
fucking paying for it.


00:58:15.848 --> 00:58:17.752
You know what I mean?


00:58:17.753 --> 00:58:19.259
- Sorry, Art.
- I love you. I love you.


00:58:19.260 --> 00:58:20.426
- Yeah, we love you, Art.
- Thank you.


00:58:20.427 --> 00:58:22.891
Just keep it...
you know, just, like...


00:58:22.892 --> 00:58:25.358
Just run, like, two miles
up the road. Okay?


00:58:27.270 --> 00:58:29.505
- Ugh.
- Well, Ray, we're alone.


00:58:31.568 --> 00:58:32.607
How 'bout it?


00:58:36.413 --> 00:58:38.338
It's just gotta stay
between us, Pete.


00:58:39.848 --> 00:58:42.551
You have my word, <i>compadre,</i>
and that means something.


00:58:46.088 --> 00:58:48.524
(SIGHS) Um...


00:58:50.126 --> 00:58:52.484
My dad, uh, you know...


00:58:57.298 --> 00:58:59.029
My dad was my hero.


00:59:00.871 --> 00:59:02.568
And, um...


00:59:02.569 --> 00:59:05.471
you know, he always
wanted to show me things


00:59:05.472 --> 00:59:08.409
that honestly could have
gotten him jailed.


00:59:08.410 --> 00:59:10.201
You know, he wanted
to show me books by,


00:59:10.202 --> 00:59:12.413
you know,
Nietzsche and Kierkegaard,


00:59:12.414 --> 00:59:14.709
Mark Twain and Camus,
and show me music,


00:59:14.710 --> 00:59:16.545
real fucking uninhibited music.


00:59:16.546 --> 00:59:17.814
- Yeah.
- And just...


00:59:17.815 --> 00:59:19.217
you know,
that was the kinda guy he was.


00:59:19.218 --> 00:59:20.745
He was uninhibited,


00:59:20.746 --> 00:59:21.920
and just, uh...


00:59:23.617 --> 00:59:25.257
you know, I don't know.
I wanted to know the old way,


00:59:25.258 --> 00:59:26.721
so he showed it to me.


00:59:26.722 --> 00:59:28.329
And all that shit's illegal now.


00:59:28.330 --> 00:59:30.254
Yeah, I think he thought
he had a system.


00:59:30.255 --> 00:59:31.530
He thought he was being
careful, but...


00:59:31.531 --> 00:59:33.797
GINNIE: <i>♪ Dublin's fair city ♪</i>


