01:01:55.807 --> 01:01:57.173
Nobody here wants it
more than I do.


01:01:57.174 --> 01:01:58.568
Yeah, I'm not arguing
with that, <i>compadre,</i> but...


01:01:58.569 --> 01:02:00.712
Listen, my dad was
the last true good person


01:02:00.713 --> 01:02:03.209
