01:02:16.559 --> 01:02:17.832
How's that good?


01:02:20.734 --> 01:02:21.964
Garraty, do you have any idea


01:02:21.965 --> 01:02:24.165
how hard it is
to fucking kill a man?


01:02:24.166 --> 01:02:25.933
I've killed a deer,
and that's hard enough.


01:02:25.934 --> 01:02:28.001
Like, killing a man is only easy


01:02:28.002 --> 01:02:30.234
for a certain kind of person.


01:02:30.235 --> 01:02:31.410
I'll become that kinda person.


01:02:31.411 --> 01:02:32.942
That'd be fucking sad.


01:02:32.943 --> 01:02:34.471
Those kinda people
can't see the beauty


01:02:34.472 --> 01:02:35.943
- in this world.
- What fucking beauty?


01:02:35.944 --> 01:02:38.076
The sky, the trees, the birds.


01:02:38.077 --> 01:02:39.579
Fuck, man, everything.


01:02:40.590 --> 01:02:41.988
Do you know
what else is beautiful?


01:02:41.989 --> 01:02:43.854
Us.


01:02:43.855 --> 01:02:46.256
'Cause we're real friends,
aren't we?


01:02:47.661 --> 01:02:49.622
Pete, what does it matter?


01:02:49.623 --> 01:02:52.125
Whether we have three hours,
three days, or three decades,


01:02:52.126 --> 01:02:54.794
