even if you pull it off,


01:03:15.780 --> 01:03:18.154
- they'll fucking kill you.
- You don't know that shit.


01:03:18.155 --> 01:03:20.257
I'll be the winner.
That's uncharted territory.


01:03:21.628 --> 01:03:22.794
What about your mom?


01:03:22.795 --> 01:03:24.055
Don't fucking bring up
my mom, Pete.


01:03:24.056 --> 01:03:25.731
What about your mom?


01:03:25.732 --> 01:03:27.525
